. * Parents remittances are TP26: tp26a/tp26ma/tp26pa = money for health and tp
> 26b/tp26mb/tp26pb = any other money. We also use tp26b_1 and so forth as thes
> e are binary variables that will capture remittances if the continuous variab
> les missed them at first. This includes mom, father, and joint. NOTE: cash_tp
>  is all 0's and 1's and I will handle impute missing later. It is this way bc
>  a skip pattern causes individuals who's parents died or lives in the househo
> ld as skip thus they truly should be zero. 
