. * School transport is converted to years and then months, same with food week
> . Also the school_year is just divided by 12 for months not by 10.5 as we spr
> ead out the cost (also we already double checked why we are using this 12 ins
> tead of 10.5)
. gen hh_expend_month = food_week * 52 / 12 + month_items + quarter_items / 3 +
>  year_items / 12 + school_year / 12 + school_transport * 10.5 / 12

. * Rowtotal counts blanks as 0, which is right for items that were skipped, bu
